* AGRI-WATT: Active Zener Demagnetization & Peak-and-Hold Driver
* SPICE Transient Simulation Netlist
* Circuit: Optocoupler -> MOSFET (IRLZ44N) -> 12V Solenoid (45mH, 18 Ohm) + Active Zener (36V)

.TITLE AGRI-WATT High-Speed Solenoid Driver SPICE Simulation

* ==============================================================================
* POWER SUPPLIES & INPUT PULSE TRAIN
* ==============================================================================
V_BAT VDD 0 DC 12.0V
V_VCC VCC_ISO 0 DC 5.0V

* ESP32-S3 GPIO 18 Pulse: 3ms Pull-In (3.3V) -> 15ms Hold (PWM 30%) -> OFF (0V)
V_IN GPIO18 0 PULSE(0.0V 3.3V 1.0ms 10us 10us 3.0ms 50.0ms)

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 1: OPTOCOUPLER GALVANIC ISOLATION (PC817 MODEL)
* ==============================================================================
R_LED GPIO18 OPTO_IN 330
D_OPTO_LED OPTO_IN 0 D_IR_LED
.MODEL D_IR_LED D(IS=1e-14 RS=2.0 BV=5.0 IBV=10u)

* Phototransistor Output
R_PULLUP VCC_ISO GATE_DRIVE 10k
Q_OPTO GATE_DRIVE OPTO_IN_EMITTER 0 Q_NPN_OPTO
.MODEL Q_NPN_OPTO NPN(IS=1e-14 BF=150 VAF=50)

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 2: POWER MOSFET SWITCH (IRLZ44N LOGIC-LEVEL N-CHANNEL)
* ==============================================================================
R_GATE GATE_DRIVE MOSFET_GATE 100
R_PULLDOWN MOSFET_GATE 0 100k

* Logic-Level MOSFET: Vth = 2.0V, Rds(on) = 22 mOhm, Ciss = 1700pF
M1 DRAIN MOSFET_GATE 0 0 IRLZ44N_MODEL
.MODEL IRLZ44N_MODEL NMOS(
+ LEVEL=3 
+ VTO=1.85 
+ KP=25.0 
+ RS=0.015 
+ RD=0.010 
+ TOX=4e-8 
+ CGSO=8e-10 
+ CGDO=3e-10 
+ CBD=1.5e-9)

* Bulk Decoupling Capacitor
C_BULK VDD 0 2200uF IC=12.0V
R_ESR VDD VDD_CLEAN 0.035

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 3: SOLENOID INDUCTIVE COIL (12V, 45mH, 18 Ohm)
* ==============================================================================
L_COIL VDD_CLEAN COIL_MID 45mH IC=0.0A
R_COIL COIL_MID DRAIN 18.0

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 4: ACTIVE 36V ZENER FLYBACK SNUBBER NETWORK
* ==============================================================================
* Series connection: Schottky SS34 (fast steering) + Zener 36V 5W (1N5365B)
* Anode of Schottky connects to Drain; Cathode connects to Cathode of Zener; Anode of Zener connects to VDD
D_SCHOTTKY DRAIN SNUB_MID SS34_MODEL
.MODEL SS34_MODEL D(IS=2e-7 RS=0.045 N=1.05 BV=40.0 IBV=1m CJO=150p)

D_ZENER VDD_CLEAN SNUB_MID ZENER_36V_MODEL
.MODEL ZENER_36V_MODEL D(IS=1e-11 RS=1.2 BV=36.0 IBV=5m NBV=1.1)

* ==============================================================================
* SIMULATION DIRECTIVES
* ==============================================================================
.TRAN 10us 25ms 0.0s 5us UIC

.PRINT TRAN V(GPIO18) V(MOSFET_GATE) V(DRAIN) I(L_COIL)

.END
